e returns none  of those plot threats have yet been  picked up since  just as the original trilogy was  fundamentally about luke skywalker's  journey the new trilogy was about kylo  ren's battle against his own dark nature  so it was fitting that the climax of  2019's star wars episode 9 the rise of  skywalker concluded with the end of his  story more conflicted than ever about  his dark side decisions after sensing  his mother's death being healed by rey  and imagining a conversation with his  father han solo kylo ren finally gives  in to the light side of the force and  becomes ben solo once again this is  echoed by rey's discovery that she is a  descendant of the evil emperor palpatine  but rather than continue the age-old  battle between their two families kylo  ren chooses to sacrifice his life to  help rey defeat the reborn palpatine the  threat ended rey returned to tatooine  and buried luke and leia's lightsabers  before officially taking on their name  to honor them in many ways star wars  episode 9 the rise of skywalker ended in  the same place that return of the jedi  left its heroes with the emperor's death  reigniting hope for a new democratic  government and a reborn jedi order led  by a powerful hero with her own original  lightsaber  like the original trilogy had the ewok  adventures and the prequels had the  clone wars the sequel trilogy has  received its own official specially made  spin-offs in the form of 2020's the lego  star wars holiday special the feature  focuses on ray skywalker's attempt to  train finn in the ways of the jedi  though both are struggling with the  prospect in an attempt to gain guidance  she travels to a temple on cordoku to  observe a special life day ritual that  ultimately allows her to travel  throughout time and meet star wars  characters from multiple different eras  including luke yoda qui-gon jinn obi-wan  kenobi and darth vader who once again  turns to the light at the end  hey what's with the sweater  after nearly breaking time by giving  vader and kylo ren access to the green  crystal that she was using to traverse  the time stream rey sets everything  right with the help of several versions  of luke skywalker and learns her lesson  life day is about spending time with  friends and family  the second of legos made for disney plus  original specials 2021's lego star wars  terrifying tales follows poe dameron as  he crash lands at vader's castle which  has been turned into the first  all-inclusive sith inspired luxury  resort it's run by grabala the hutt  whose creepy caretaker vinay begins  telling post stories in an effort to  trick him and a young boy named dean  into retrieving one of vader's holocrons  as they go dean and poe bond over their  shared rough childhoods but vinay  retrieves the holocron and uses it to  form and power a massive exoskeleton  dean uses poe's x-wing to get it back  but vinay captures poe and holds him  over a cliff in order to deliver his  ultimatum hand over the artifact or  watch poe die though the boy is almost  overcome with fear dean finds his  courage and throws the holocron over  vinay's head and into the lava below  binet catches the device but falls to  his death in the fire below while bb-8  successfully catches poe and saves him  from the same fate afterward poe forces  the hutt to close his hotel putting dean  out of a job so that poe can take him to  rey to train in the ways of the force  however as they all leave a mysterious  hand and a laugh reach out from the lava  showing that vinay has survived to be  continued who knows what the next star  wars movie will bring us check out one  of our newest videos right here plus  even more looper videos about your  favorite films are coming soon subscribe  to our youtube channel and hit the bell  so you don't miss a single one  [Music]  you
 

